'''Ranger [[Ascalon armor]]''' is an art type introduced in the Prophecies campaign as starter armor (named '''Rawhide''') and is also available in the Factions campaign.

'''Note''': Ranger Ascalon armor does not have headgear. Instead, newly created characters get a [[Ranger Simple Mask|Simple Mask]] named ''Ranger Mask''. You can craft masks using Prophecies art from the same armorers in Factions.
* [[Ranger Simple Mask]], only at max AR
* [[Ranger Hunter Mask]]
* [[Ranger Tamer Mask]], only with non-max AR
* [[Ranger Traveler Mask]], only with non-max AR

There is no [[prestige armor|prestige]] version of Ascalon armor.

